WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.090
car was stolen!"

2
00:00:15.292 --> 00:00:16.472
Roxy flew down the alley.

3
00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:19.814
A man held a car key.

4
00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:21.675
He looked furious.

5
00:00:21.695 --> 00:00:24.097
"How will I get to work now?

6
00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:27.539
I paid a lot of money for that car!"

7
00:00:28.299 --> 00:00:29.480
Detective Smith ran over.

8
00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:31.837
"Who stole your car?"

9
00:00:32.057 --> 00:00:32.697
Roxy asked.

10
00:00:32.717 --> 00:00:34.398
"Did you see the thief?"

11
00:00:35.599 --> 00:00:36.979
"No," the man said.

12
00:00:36.999 --> 00:00:38.720
"But I saw his truck!"

13
00:00:39.941 --> 00:00:41.562
Detective Smith took out his notepad.

14
00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:42.983
"What does it look like?"

15
00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.445
"It's a garbage truck," the man said.

16
00:00:46.465 --> 00:00:49.907
"It says Trashman's Trash Pickup on the side."

17
00:00:50.907 --> 00:00:52.108
Roxy was confused.

18
00:00:52.128 --> 00:00:54.449
"The thief was in a garbage truck.

19
00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:56.490
So how did he steal your car?"

20
00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.629
"The truck has a big arm with a claw," the man said.

21
00:01:01.349 --> 00:01:03.411
He held out his arm to show how the claw worked.

22
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:06.994
"The claw grabbed my car and put it in the back of the truck!"

23
00:01:07.675 --> 00:01:09.977
The man kicked a coffee cup lying on the sidewalk.

24
00:01:09.997 --> 00:01:13.559
"Trashman stinks at his job.

25
00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.902
He picked up my car, but he didn't pick up any of this trash!"

26
00:01:16.922 --> 00:01:20.365
"Hmm," Detective Smith said.

27
00:01:20.385 --> 00:01:23.908
"Maybe Trashman robbed Metro City Electronics too."

28
00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:26.110
Roxy nodded.

29
00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:28.152
"We should find out."

30
00:01:29.248 --> 00:01:31.910
Detective Smith looked up the address for Trashman's Trash Pickup.

31
00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:35.273
"The headquarters is just north of the city."

32
00:01:35.293 --> 00:01:38.555
"I'll go check it out, Detective!"

33
00:01:40.577 --> 00:01:41.377
Roxy flew off.

34
00:01:43.999 --> 00:01:46.481
Moments later Roxy landed in front of a huge building.

35
00:01:47.762 --> 00:01:49.683
She went inside and entered an enormous room.

36
00:01:51.785 --> 00:01:53.286
Piles of trash surrounded her.

37
00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:55.408
Roxy heard a sound.

38
00:01:56.732 --> 00:01:59.014
A man was carrying a box at the other end of the room.

39
00:02:00.615 --> 00:02:01.916
Some nice cars were parked near him.

40
00:02:03.297 --> 00:02:04.978
He wore a filthy, ripped jacket.

41
00:02:05.818 --> 00:02:08.400
His hair and beard stuck out in all different directions.

42
00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.682
"Trashman!" Roxy shouted.

43
00:02:13.063 --> 00:02:14.784
The man dropped the box he'd been carrying.

44
00:02:15.705 --> 00:02:16.806
"Rocket Girl!

45
00:02:17.286 --> 00:02:18.487
What are—ahugh!

46
00:02:18.507 --> 00:02:20.769
Ahugh!" The man coughed.

47
00:02:21.389 --> 00:02:22.970
"What are you doing here?"

48
00:02:24.051 --> 00:02:25.412
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

49
00:02:26.304 --> 00:02:29.586
"You've been stealing things instead of picking up trash."

50
00:02:31.247 --> 00:02:32.468
Trashman folded his arms.

51
00:02:32.488 --> 00:02:34.089
"So what?

52
00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.431
I'm tired of all this trash.

53
00:02:36.851 --> 00:02:39.193
I decided to steal some nice things!"

54
00:02:40.413 --> 00:02:41.634
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

55
00:02:41.654 --> 00:02:45.837
"You won't have any nice things where you're going—jail!"

56
00:02:47.078 --> 00:02:48.799
Trashman laughed and then coughed again.

57
00:02:52.562 --> 00:02:55.904
way! I'm putting you out with the trash!"

58
00:02:56.668 --> 00:02:58.569
He stepped over to the wall and pulled a lever.

59
00:02:59.469 --> 00:03:02.650
Clank! Doors opened above Roxy's head.

60
00:03:04.491 --> 00:03:05.751
Then Shwoompf!

61
00:03:06.612 --> 00:03:10.613
Tons of trash crashed down on her.

62
00:03:10.633 --> 00:03:11.934
"Ha-ha! Ahugh!

63
00:03:12.334 --> 00:03:14.755
Ahugh!" Trashman ran out the door.

64
00:03:14.775 --> 00:03:17.796
"So long, Rocket Girl!"
